[2026-01-29T23:41:11.448Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01LFMuRpfifW5EquXWZ1QcEv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015ExGWyEX2JuCh6Ufhv1Bcp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Theming & Cards\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727798577_zneo2y1\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Theming & Cards\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement comprehensive animation framework with theme-specific motion profiles and performance optimization\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Theme-Specific Animation Framework\\n\\n### Vision\\nBuild a centralized animation system that provides theme-appropriate motion profiles (dramatic for Radar, subtle for Swiss), respects user preferences, and optimizes performance through intelligent animation scheduling and GPU acceleration hints.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- **Brand differentiation**: Radar theme feels futuristic and dynamic; Swiss feels precise and professional\\n- **Performance**: Reduced jank and smoother 60fps animations on all devices\\n- **Accessibility**: Full reduced-motion support for users who need it\\n- **Consistency**: Unified timing functions and duration scales across all components\\n- **Developer experience**: Simple API for complex choreographed animations\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Animation configuration system with theme-specific profiles\\n- Staggered animation orchestrator for list/grid reveals\\n- Performance-optimized animation primitives\\n- Reduced-motion fallbacks for all animations\\n- GPU acceleration hints (will-change, transform3d)\\n- Animation debugging tools for development\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Physics-based animations (spring systems beyond Framer Motion)\\n- Video/canvas animations\\n- Page transitions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **AnimationConfig** - Theme-specific timing, easing, and duration definitions\\n2. **useStaggeredReveal** - Hook for orchestrated list animations\\n3. **AnimatedPresence** - Enhanced AnimatePresence with theme awareness\\n4. **MotionPresets** - Pre-built animation variants (fadeIn, slideUp, scaleIn, etc.)\\n5. **PerformanceMonitor** - Dev tool for animation frame rate monitoring\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Integrate with prefers-reduced-motion media query\\n- Use requestAnimationFrame scheduling for complex sequences\\n- Implement animation batching to reduce layout thrashing\\n- Define theme-specific duration, easing, and stagger values\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Animations maintain 60fps on mid-range devices\\n- Reduced-motion mode eliminates all non-essential motion\\n- Theme switch smoothly transitions animation profiles\\n- Staggered animations feel choreographed, not random\\n- Developer can create new animations using presets in under 2 minutes\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Coordinating animations across independently-mounted components\\n- Balancing visual richness with performance on mobile\\n- Ensuring Framer Motion and custom animations work together\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save direction 3 for Report Theming"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2274,"cache_read_input_tokens":159171,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2274},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"88c206bd-5514-4ec2-a690-0d8cebc5c1db"}
