[2026-01-29T23:41:46.627Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_0196oAytCpjAEsmH33uLiGAf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013w58zrNcnMLSLNukyjYxRE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build unified feature orchestration layer with keyboard shortcuts, feature discovery UI, and persistent preferences\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Feature Orchestration & Discovery System\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a central feature management system that coordinates FocusMode, SpeedReader, IntelDashboard, and KeyPointsPanel - providing discoverable UI triggers, global keyboard shortcuts, persistent user preferences, and coordinated state management across features.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- **Feature discovery**: Users actually find and use the advanced features we built\\n- **Power user productivity**: Keyboard shortcuts enable 2-3x faster navigation\\n- **Personalization**: Preferences persist across sessions, reducing friction\\n- **Reduced support burden**: Clear feature discoverability reduces confusion\\n- **Premium perception**: Polished feature system signals professional product\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- FeatureController context managing all feature states\\n- Feature toolbar with visible triggers for each feature\\n- Global keyboard shortcut registry with conflict detection\\n- Feature preference persistence (WPM, highlight keywords, etc.)\\n- Feature help overlays with first-time tutorials\\n- Cross-feature coordination (e.g., SpeedReader in FocusMode)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Voice activation\\n- Gesture controls for desktop\\n- Feature usage analytics backend\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **FeatureController** - Central state manager for all interactive features\\n2. **FeatureToolbar** - Visible buttons for Focus, Speed Reader, Dashboard, KeyPoints\\n3. **ShortcutRegistry** - Global keyboard handler with customizable bindings\\n4. **FeaturePreferences** - LocalStorage-backed preference system\\n5. **FeatureTutorials** - First-time user onboarding overlays\\n6. **FeatureHelp** - Keyboard shortcut reference panel\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use React Context for FeatureController with useReducer for state\\n- Implement keyboard event delegation at document level\\n- Store preferences in localStorage with schema versioning\\n- Create feature stacking rules (which features can coexist)\\n- Add analytics hooks for feature usage tracking (future)\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- All features accessible via both UI buttons and keyboard shortcuts\\n- No keyboard shortcut conflicts with browser or OS\\n- WPM preference persists across page reloads\\n- New users see feature discovery hints on first visit\\n- Power users can activate any feature in under 2 keystrokes\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Keyboard shortcut conflicts with existing report shortcuts\\n- Managing z-index layers for stacked features\\n- Mobile-friendly alternatives to keyboard shortcuts\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save direction 1 for Interactive Features"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":164683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"0b9ec2cb-4cb4-481f-8ccf-6c7e308e3940"}
