calStorage-backed preference system\\n5. **FeatureTutorials** - First-time user onboarding overlays\\n6. **FeatureHelp** - Keyboard shortcut reference panel\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use React Context for FeatureController with useReducer for state\\n- Implement keyboard event delegation at document level\\n- Store preferences in localStorage with schema versioning\\n- Create feature stacking rules (which features can coexist)\\n- Add analytics hooks for feature usage tracking (future)\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- All features accessible via both UI buttons and keyboard shortcuts\\n- No keyboard shortcut conflicts with browser or OS\\n- WPM preference persists across page reloads\\n- New users see feature discovery hints on first visit\\n- Power users can activate any feature in under 2 keystrokes\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Keyboard shortcut conflicts with existing report shortcuts\\n- Managing z-index layers for stacked features\\n- Mobile-friendly alternatives to keyboard shortcuts\",\"summary\":\"Build unified feature orchestration layer with keyboard shortcuts, feature discovery UI, and persistent preferences\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:41:48.012Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:41:48.012Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\"context_name\":\"Report Interactive Features\",\"context_group_id\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"f7b586dc-6364-437f-bf9c-4e5b91f89656","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_23ab874d-12ba-4f07-a083-71fe3fdf69c3\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Interactive Features\",\"direction\":\"## Feature Orchestration & Discovery System\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a central feature management system that coordinates FocusMod