buttons and keyboard shortcuts\\n- No keyboard shortcut conflicts with browser or OS\\n- WPM preference persists across page reloads\\n- New users see feature discovery hints on first visit\\n- Power users can activate any feature in under 2 keystrokes\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Keyboard shortcut conflicts with existing report shortcuts\\n- Managing z-index layers for stacked features\\n- Mobile-friendly alternatives to keyboard shortcuts\",\"summary\":\"Build unified feature orchestration layer with keyboard shortcuts, feature discovery UI, and persistent preferences\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:41:48.012Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:41:48.012Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\"context_name\":\"Report Interactive Features\",\"context_group_id\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-29T23:42:02.624Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_0196oAytCpjAEsmH33uLiGAf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CLqGvVMC9DtRLeXvops5np","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement smart content extraction and context-aware feature activation with AI-powered highlighting\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Smart Content Extraction & AI-Powered Features\\n\\n### Vision\\nEnhance interactive features with intelligent content understanding - auto-detecting key passages for SpeedReader, generating highlight keywords from findings, and providing context-aware feature suggestions based on what the user is viewing.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- **Reduced friction**: No manual content selection required for SpeedReader\\n- **Smarter highlights**: AI-extracted keywords improve FocusMode value\\n- **Contextual assistance**: Right feature suggested at the right time\\n- **Competitive differentiation**: AI-enhanced reading features are unique\\n- **Increased feature adoption**: Smart defaults encourage feature use\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Auto-extract key passages from findings for SpeedReader\\n- AI-generated keyword lists from perspective insights\\n- Context detector (which finding/perspective is in view)\\n- Feature suggestion system (e.g., suggest SpeedReader for long text)\\n- Selection-triggered feature activation (select text to speed read)\\n- Smart summarization for KeyPointsPanel\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time AI processing (use pre-extracted data)\\n- Voice narration of findings\\n- Translation features\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **ContentExtractor** - Extracts key passages from session data\\n2. **KeywordGenerator** - Derives highlight keywords from perspectives\\n3. **ContextDetector** - Tracks which content section is in view\\n4. **FeatureSuggester** - Recommends features based on content type\\n5. **SelectionHandler** - Enables text selection to trigger features\\n6. **SmartSummarizer** - Generates key points from findings automatically\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use Intersection Observer for context detection\\n- Extract keywords from perspective.key_insights\\n- Implement text selection API for selection-triggered features\\n- Create content scoring for speed reader prioritization\\n- Pre-compute summaries during session load\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- SpeedReader can start with one click on any finding\\n- FocusMode highlights 5-10 relevant keywords automatically\\n- Feature suggestions appear within 500ms of content visibility\\n- KeyPointsPanel shows AI-prioritized points, not just first N\\n- Selection-to-SpeedReader takes under 1 second\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Performance impact of content analysis\\n- Accuracy of auto-extracted keywords\\n- Balancing suggestions without being intrusive\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save direction 2 for Interactive Features"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":164683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"b6691049-a779-4dee-bf8e-f888d2a13b47"}
