[2026-01-29T23:42:16.204Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_0196oAytCpjAEsmH33uLiGAf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U9yDnCUUHbugETFc7CXHRS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Interactive Features\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build comprehensive annotation and note-taking system with export and collaboration capabilities\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Annotation & Note-Taking System\\n\\n### Vision\\nEnable users to annotate findings, highlight text, add personal notes, and export their annotations - transforming passive report reading into active knowledge capture that can be shared with teams or exported for other workflows.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- **Active learning**: Annotations increase retention and engagement\\n- **Knowledge capture**: Personal notes create persistent value from research\\n- **Team collaboration**: Share annotations with colleagues\\n- **Export flexibility**: Annotations flow into other tools and workflows\\n- **Premium feature**: Note-taking is expected in professional research tools\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Text highlighting with color categories\\n- Inline notes attached to specific findings\\n- General notes panel for session-level thoughts\\n- Annotation export (Markdown, JSON, PDF annotations)\\n- Annotation persistence in localStorage (and backend sync ready)\\n- Annotation sharing via URL with embedded annotations\\n- Keyboard shortcuts for common annotation actions\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time collaborative annotation (multi-user simultaneous)\\n- Voice notes\\n- Drawing/sketch annotations\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **AnnotationProvider** - Context for managing all annotations\\n2. **Highlighter** - Text selection and highlight application\\n3. **NoteEditor** - Rich text editor for inline notes\\n4. **AnnotationSidebar** - Panel showing all annotations\\n5. **AnnotationExporter** - Export annotations to various formats\\n6. **AnnotationSync** - LocalStorage + API sync layer\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use Selection API for text highlighting\\n- Store annotations with finding IDs and text ranges\\n- Implement optimistic updates with background sync\\n- Use react-contenteditable for inline note editing\\n- Generate shareable URLs with annotation state encoded\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Highlight any text with 2 clicks\\n- Add note to any finding with keyboard shortcut\\n- Export all annotations as structured markdown\\n- Annotations persist across page reloads\\n- Shared annotation URL shows highlights to recipient\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Text range persistence when content updates\\n- Highlight styling across theme variations\\n- Merging annotations from multiple sources\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save direction 3 for Interactive Features"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":164683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":412},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"9b79530d-2922-4f9b-811b-2c37eedcd65f"}
