stale-while-revalidate\\n- Implement hover intent detection (150ms delay before prefetch trigger)\\n- Use react-window or virtuoso for list virtualization\\n- Store prefetch priorities based on tab adjacency and user history\\n- Progressive reveal: summary -> details -> full data\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/TabPrefetchManager.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/VirtualizedFindingList.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/ProgressiveSection.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTabPrefetch.ts`\\n- Modify: All existing tab files for progressive disclosure\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/Skeletons.tsx`\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Tab switches feel instant (<50ms perceived latency)\\n- Memory usage stays flat regardless of finding count\\n- Prefetch hit rate >70% for adjacent tabs\\n- Progressive disclosure reduces initial render by 60%\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Balancing prefetch aggressiveness with bandwidth usage\\n- Cache invalidation when underlying data changes\\n- Virtualization scroll position preservation\",\"summary\":\"Implement smart tab preloading with intelligent data prefetch, progressive disclosure, and memory-efficient virtualization\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:05.886Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:05.886Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_name\":\"Report Tabs\",\"context_group_id\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"5239aaff-4d28-4fa8-b450-2a4d9ee4ad5b","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_608d91c9-9676-45af-80f7-32974f966234\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Tabs\",\"direction\":\"## Smart Tab Preloading & Progressive Disclosure System\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the tab system from a simple navigation component into an intelligent content delivery system that anticipates user intent, prefetches data intelligently, and provides progressive disclosure of complex information while maintaining optimal memory usage.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Perceived performance improvement of 50-80% through predictive loading\\n- Reduced server load via intelligent caching and deduplication\\n- Better user experience with instant tab switches\\n- Lower bounce rates as users can explore content fluidly\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Intelligent prefetching based on user behavior patterns\\n- Progressive disclosure with expandable sections and lazy-loaded details\\n- Memory-efficient virtualization for large datasets (100+ findings)\\n- Tab content caching with smart invalidation\\n- Loading skeleton states that match actual content layout\\n- Intersection Observer-based lazy loading for off-screen content\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Server-side prediction algorithms\\n- Cross-session learning\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **TabPrefetchManager** - Tracks hover intent and scroll patterns to predict next tab\\n2. **ProgressiveSection** - Wrapper that reveals content in stages\\n3. **VirtualizedList** - Windowed rendering for large finding/source lists\\n4. **ContentCache** - LRU cache for tab content with TTL\\n5. **SkeletonFactory** - Generates matching skeletons for each tab type\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use React Query for data fetching with stale-while-revalidate\\n- Implement hover intent detection (150ms delay before prefetch trigger)\\n- Use react-window or virtuoso for list virtualization\\n- Store prefetch priorities based on tab adjacency and user history\\n- Progressive reveal: summary -> details -> full data\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/TabPrefetchManager.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/VirtualizedFindingList.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/tabs/ProgressiveSection.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTabPrefetch.ts`\\n- Modify: All existing tab files for progressive disclosure\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/Skeletons.tsx`\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Tab switches feel instant (<50ms perceived latency)\\n- Memory usage stays flat regardless of finding count\\n- Prefetch hit rate >70% for adjacent tabs\\n- Progressive disclosure reduces initial render by 60%\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Balancing prefetch aggressiveness with bandwidth usage\\n- Cache invalidation when underlying data changes\\n- Virtualization scroll position preservation\",\"summary\":\"Implement smart tab preloading with intelligent data prefetch, progressive disclosure, and memory-efficient virtualization\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:05.886Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:05.886Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_name\":\"Report Tabs\",\"context_group_id\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-29T23:44:25.652Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01KQ1Ybskh8ePD6hBCsyu1MW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Eggb69obWk8YEeZ2nJ3rMG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Tabs\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Tabs\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build cross-tab data linking system with bidirectional navigation, context preservation, and relationship highlighting\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Cross-Tab Data Linking & Relationship Navigation\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a unified navigation experience where related data across tabs is interconnected. When viewing a finding, instantly see and navigate to its supporting sources. When examining an entity, jump to all findings that mention it. Build a web of relationships that users can traverse fluidly.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Dramatically faster insight discovery through connected navigation\\n- Reduced cognitive load - no need to remember and manually search\\n- Deeper understanding of research through relationship visualization\\n- Professional-grade research tool experience expected by analysts\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Bidirectional linking between findings, sources, entities, and analysis\\n- Inline link previews on hover (show snippet without navigation)\\n- Breadcrumb trail for cross-tab navigation history\\n- Highlight related items when navigating from another tab\\n- Quick-jump indicators showing relationship counts\\n- Context preservation when switching tabs (scroll position, expanded state)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full knowledge graph visualization (separate context)\\n- AI-generated relationship suggestions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **RelationshipRegistry** - Central store mapping all cross-entity relationships\\n2. **LinkedReference** - Inline component for clickable cross-references\\n3. **LinkPreviewPopover** - Hover preview of linked content\\n4. **NavigationBreadcrumbs** - Trail of cross-tab jumps\\n5. **RelatedHighlighter** - Highlights items related to navigation source\\n6. **TabStatePreserver** - Saves and restores per-tab state\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Build relationship index during data load (O(n) preprocessing)\\n- Use React context for cross-tab communication\\n- Implement hover delay with cancel-on-leave for previews\\n- Store navigation history in URL params for shareability\\n- Use CSS transitions for highlight animations\\n- Debounce state saves to prevent thrashing\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/lib/relationshipRegistry.ts`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkedReference.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkPreviewPopover.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/NavigationBreadcrumbs.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useRelationshipNavigation.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTabState.ts`\\n- Modify: FindingsTab.tsx - Add source/entity links\\n- Modify: SourcesTab.tsx - Add finding backlinks\\n- Modify: EntitiesTab.tsx - Add finding/source connections\\n- Modify: AnalysisTab.tsx - Link contradictions to sources\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Click on source in FindingCard navigates to SourcesTab with highlight\\n- Hover on entity shows preview with mention count and finding links\\n- Navigation trail allows quick backtracking\\n- State preserved when returning to a tab\\n- Links shareable via URL\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Performance with many relationships (need efficient indexing)\\n- Preview positioning near viewport edges\\n- Circular reference handling in navigation history\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Tabs direction 2"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens