[2026-01-29T23:44:27.030Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Eggb69obWk8YEeZ2nJ3rMG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_43f45895-174a-4be5-ac36-f874096a5b74\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Tabs\",\"direction\":\"## Cross-Tab Data Linking & Relationship Navigation\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a unified navigation experience where related data across tabs is interconnected. When viewing a finding, instantly see and navigate to its supporting sources. When examining an entity, jump to all findings that mention it. Build a web of relationships that users can traverse fluidly.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Dramatically faster insight discovery through connected navigation\\n- Reduced cognitive load - no need to remember and manually search\\n- Deeper understanding of research through relationship visualization\\n- Professional-grade research tool experience expected by analysts\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Bidirectional linking between findings, sources, entities, and analysis\\n- Inline link previews on hover (show snippet without navigation)\\n- Breadcrumb trail for cross-tab navigation history\\n- Highlight related items when navigating from another tab\\n- Quick-jump indicators showing relationship counts\\n- Context preservation when switching tabs (scroll position, expanded state)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full knowledge graph visualization (separate context)\\n- AI-generated relationship suggestions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **RelationshipRegistry** - Central store mapping all cross-entity relationships\\n2. **LinkedReference** - Inline component for clickable cross-references\\n3. **LinkPreviewPopover** - Hover preview of linked content\\n4. **NavigationBreadcrumbs** - Trail of cross-tab jumps\\n5. **RelatedHighlighter** - Highlights items related to navigation source\\n6. **TabStatePreserver** - Saves and restores per-tab state\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Build relationship index during data load (O(n) preprocessing)\\n- Use React context for cross-tab communication\\n- Implement hover delay with cancel-on-leave for previews\\n- Store navigation history in URL params for shareability\\n- Use CSS transitions for highlight animations\\n- Debounce state saves to prevent thrashing\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/lib/relationshipRegistry.ts`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkedReference.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkPreviewPopover.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/NavigationBreadcrumbs.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useRelationshipNavigation.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTabState.ts`\\n- Modify: FindingsTab.tsx - Add source/entity links\\n- Modify: SourcesTab.tsx - Add finding backlinks\\n- Modify: EntitiesTab.tsx - Add finding/source connections\\n- Modify: AnalysisTab.tsx - Link contradictions to sources\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Click on source in FindingCard navigates to SourcesTab with highlight\\n- Hover on entity shows preview with mention count and finding links\\n- Navigation trail allows quick backtracking\\n- State preserved when returning to a tab\\n- Links shareable via URL\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Performance with many relationships (need efficient indexing)\\n- Preview positioning near viewport edges\\n- Circular reference handling in navigation history\",\"summary\":\"Build cross-tab data linking system with bidirectional navigation, context preservation, and relationship highlighting\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:26.741Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:26.741Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_name\":\"Report Tabs\",\"context_group_id\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"e26fae59-b476-435d-997c-1abf67306f4f","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_43f45895-174a-4be5-ac36-f874096a5b74\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Tabs\",\"direction\":\"## Cross-Tab Data Linking & Relationship Navigation\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a unified navigation experience where related data across tabs is interconnected. When viewing a finding, instantly see and navigate to its supporting sources. When examining an entity, jump to all findings that mention it. Build a web of relationships that users can traverse fluidly.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Dramatically faster insight discovery through connected navigation\\n- Reduced cognitive load - no need to remember and manually search\\n- Deeper understanding of research through relationship visualization\\n- Professional-grade research tool experience expected by analysts\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Bidirectional linking between findings, sources, entities, and analysis\\n- Inline link previews on hover (show snippet without navigation)\\n- Breadcrumb trail for cross-tab navigation history\\n- Highlight related items when navigating from another tab\\n- Quick-jump indicators showing relationship counts\\n- Context preservation when switching tabs (scroll position, expanded state)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full knowledge graph visualization (separate context)\\n- AI-generated relationship suggestions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **RelationshipRegistry** - Central store mapping all cross-entity relationships\\n2. **LinkedReference** - Inline component for clickable cross-references\\n3. **LinkPreviewPopover** - Hover preview of linked content\\n4. **NavigationBreadcrumbs** - Trail of cross-tab jumps\\n5. **RelatedHighlighter** - Highlights items related to navigation source\\n6. **TabStatePreserver** - Saves and restores per-tab state\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Build relationship index during data load (O(n) preprocessing)\\n- Use React context for cross-tab communication\\n- Implement hover delay with cancel-on-leave for previews\\n- Store navigation history in URL params for shareability\\n- Use CSS transitions for highlight animations\\n- Debounce state saves to prevent thrashing\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/lib/relationshipRegistry.ts`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkedReference.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/shared/LinkPreviewPopover.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/NavigationBreadcrumbs.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useRelationshipNavigation.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTabState.ts`\\n- Modify: FindingsTab.tsx - Add source/entity links\\n- Modify: SourcesTab.tsx - Add finding backlinks\\n- Modify: EntitiesTab.tsx - Add finding/source connections\\n- Modify: AnalysisTab.tsx - Link contradictions to sources\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Click on source in FindingCard navigates to SourcesTab with highlight\\n- Hover on entity shows preview with mention count and finding links\\n- Navigation trail allows quick backtracking\\n- State preserved when returning to a tab\\n- Links shareable via URL\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Performance with many relationships (need efficient indexing)\\n- Preview positioning near viewport edges\\n- Circular reference handling in navigation history\",\"summary\":\"Build cross-tab data linking system with bidirectional navigation, context preservation, and relationship highlighting\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:26.741Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:44:26.741Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\"context_name\":\"Report Tabs\",\"context_group_id\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-29T23:44:45.360Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01LnztfTh9u9my1s1B99zvgj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019UUun7UX8huhcMewxPXpUB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Tabs\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Tabs\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement advanced filtering and faceted search system with saved filter presets, bulk operations, and comparison mode\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Advanced Filtering, Faceted Search & Comparison System\\n\\n### Vision\\nElevate the tab filtering from basic dropdowns to a professional-grade faceted search system with boolean logic, saved presets, bulk operations, and side-by-side comparison capabilities. Enable analysts to slice data in any dimension and compare subsets.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- 10x faster data exploration for power users\\n- Saved workflows reduce repetitive filtering\\n- Comparison mode enables competitive analysis within findings\\n- Export filtered subsets for downstream workflows\\n- Enterprise-grade research tool positioning\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Multi-facet filtering with AND/OR logic\\n- Type-ahead search with fuzzy matching\\n- Date range pickers with relative presets (last 7 days, this quarter)\\n- Saved filter presets with naming and quick-access\\n- Bulk selection with select-all, invert, clear\\n- Side-by-side comparison view for selected items\\n- Filter sharing via URL encoding\\n- Quick filters: unverified, high-priority, contradicted\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full-text search within source documents\\n- AI-powered filter suggestions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **FacetedFilterBar** - Horizontal bar with active filters and quick toggles\\n2. **FilterBuilder** - Advanced modal for complex filter construction\\n3. **FilterPresetManager** - Save, load, delete, share filter presets\\n4. **BulkActionBar** - Actions for selected items (export, compare, tag)\\n5. **ComparisonDrawer** - Side-by-side view of 2-4 selected items\\n6. **QuickFilterChips** - One-click preset filters for common needs\\n7. **DateRangePicker** - Intuitive date filtering with presets\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Build filter DSL: {field, operator, value, conjunction}\\n- Store presets in localStorage with cloud sync option\\n- Use URL search params for shareable filter state\\n- Implement Cmd+Click for multi-select\\n- Comparison uses CSS Grid for responsive layouts\\n- Fuzzy search via fuse.js for type-ahead\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/filters/FacetedFilterBar.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/filters/FilterBuilder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/filters/FilterPresetManager.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/filters/DateRangePicker.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/filters/QuickFilterChips.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/BulkActionBar.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ComparisonDrawer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/filterDSL.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useFilterState.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useBulkSelection.ts`\\n- Modify: All tab files to integrate new filter system\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Build complex filter in <10 seconds\\n- Filter URL encodes entire state for sharing\\n- Presets persist across sessions\\n- Compare up to 4 findings side-by-side\\n- Bulk export selected items to CSV/JSON\\n- Type-ahead responds in <50ms\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Filter DSL complexity vs usability balance\\n- URL length limits for complex filters\\n- Comparison layout for items with varying content lengths\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Tabs direction 3"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2254,"cache_read_input_tokens":59449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2254},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"f3dd833c-53ea-4c6f-99c2-d3e818f45633"}
