[2026-01-29T23:45:33.622Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01JMgrMdxiqcnYLAhWuM3ADq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019tARricjb76KXkcXe6HkZc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Views\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Views\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement customizable view layouts with drag-and-drop composition, saved configurations, and responsive breakpoint optimization\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Customizable View Layouts with Composition System\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform fixed report views into a composable layout system where users can arrange, resize, and combine view components to create personalized dashboards. Save layouts per research type, share configurations with teams, and automatically optimize for device breakpoints.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Personalized experience increases engagement and retention\\n- Power users create workflows optimized for their specific needs\\n- Team layout sharing creates viral adoption within organizations\\n- Responsive optimization improves mobile/tablet experience\\n- Premium feature potential for enterprise tier\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Drag-and-drop layout builder for view components\\n- Resizable panels with snap-to-grid\\n- Layout templates: Analyst (data-heavy), Executive (summary-focused), Researcher (exploration)\\n- Save/load named layouts with thumbnails\\n- Auto-responsive layout adaptation per breakpoint\\n- Component visibility toggles (show/hide sections)\\n- Layout sharing via URL or export\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time collaborative layout editing\\n- Custom component creation (users work with existing view parts)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **LayoutEngine** - Core layout state management with grid system\\n2. **DraggableViewPanel** - Wrapper making any view component draggable/resizable\\n3. **LayoutBuilder** - UI for creating and editing layouts\\n4. **LayoutTemplateGallery** - Pre-built layout selection\\n5. **LayoutPersistence** - Save/load/share layout configurations\\n6. **ResponsiveLayoutAdapter** - Breakpoint-aware layout transformation\\n7. **ComponentRegistry** - Registry of all available view components\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use react-grid-layout for drag/drop and resize\\n- Store layouts as JSON schema: {id, grid: [{component, x, y, w, h}]}\\n- CSS Container Queries for responsive panels\\n- LocalStorage + cloud sync for persistence\\n- URL encoding for shareable layouts (base64 compressed)\\n- Lazy load components not in initial viewport\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutEngine.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/DraggableViewPanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutBuilder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutTemplateGallery.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/ResponsiveLayoutAdapter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/layoutSchema.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useLayout.ts`\\n- Modify: All view files to be layout-aware\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx for layout mode integration\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Drag component to new position with smooth animation\\n- Resize panels with live preview\\n- Layout persists across sessions\\n- Mobile layout auto-adapts from desktop configuration\\n- Share layout via URL to colleague, they see same view\\n- Switch between 3+ saved layouts instantly\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Grid layout complexity on very small screens\\n- Performance with many draggable components\\n- Layout migration when component inventory changes\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Views direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5801,"cache_read_input_tokens":71916,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5801},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"72a42497-60e8-4e69-ba7c-6bb59f0c470a"}
[2026-01-29T23:45:35.493Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019tARricjb76KXkcXe6HkZc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_7964dc37-7336-491e-b7be-a56aab1df5e2\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Views\",\"direction\":\"## Customizable View Layouts with Composition System\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform fixed report views into a composable layout system where users can arrange, resize, and combine view components to create personalized dashboards. Save layouts per research type, share configurations with teams, and automatically optimize for device breakpoints.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Personalized experience increases engagement and retention\\n- Power users create workflows optimized for their specific needs\\n- Team layout sharing creates viral adoption within organizations\\n- Responsive optimization improves mobile/tablet experience\\n- Premium feature potential for enterprise tier\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Drag-and-drop layout builder for view components\\n- Resizable panels with snap-to-grid\\n- Layout templates: Analyst (data-heavy), Executive (summary-focused), Researcher (exploration)\\n- Save/load named layouts with thumbnails\\n- Auto-responsive layout adaptation per breakpoint\\n- Component visibility toggles (show/hide sections)\\n- Layout sharing via URL or export\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time collaborative layout editing\\n- Custom component creation (users work with existing view parts)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **LayoutEngine** - Core layout state management with grid system\\n2. **DraggableViewPanel** - Wrapper making any view component draggable/resizable\\n3. **LayoutBuilder** - UI for creating and editing layouts\\n4. **LayoutTemplateGallery** - Pre-built layout selection\\n5. **LayoutPersistence** - Save/load/share layout configurations\\n6. **ResponsiveLayoutAdapter** - Breakpoint-aware layout transformation\\n7. **ComponentRegistry** - Registry of all available view components\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use react-grid-layout for drag/drop and resize\\n- Store layouts as JSON schema: {id, grid: [{component, x, y, w, h}]}\\n- CSS Container Queries for responsive panels\\n- LocalStorage + cloud sync for persistence\\n- URL encoding for shareable layouts (base64 compressed)\\n- Lazy load components not in initial viewport\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutEngine.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/DraggableViewPanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutBuilder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutTemplateGallery.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/ResponsiveLayoutAdapter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/layoutSchema.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useLayout.ts`\\n- Modify: All view files to be layout-aware\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx for layout mode integration\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Drag component to new position with smooth animation\\n- Resize panels with live preview\\n- Layout persists across sessions\\n- Mobile layout auto-adapts from desktop configuration\\n- Share layout via URL to colleague, they see same view\\n- Switch between 3+ saved layouts instantly\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Grid layout complexity on very small screens\\n- Performance with many draggable components\\n- Layout migration when component inventory changes\",\"summary\":\"Implement customizable view layouts with drag-and-drop composition, saved configurations, and responsive breakpoint optimization\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:45:35.108Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:45:35.108Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_name\":\"Report Views\",\"context_group_id\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"da48202f-8e14-4d2c-bc08-0f194a575a0c","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_7964dc37-7336-491e-b7be-a56aab1df5e2\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Views\",\"direction\":\"## Customizable View Layouts with Composition System\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform fixed report views into a composable layout system where users can arrange, resize, and combine view components to create personalized dashboards. Save layouts per research type, share configurations with teams, and automatically optimize for device breakpoints.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Personalized experience increases engagement and retention\\n- Power users create workflows optimized for their specific needs\\n- Team layout sharing creates viral adoption within organizations\\n- Responsive optimization improves mobile/tablet experience\\n- Premium feature potential for enterprise tier\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Drag-and-drop layout builder for view components\\n- Resizable panels with snap-to-grid\\n- Layout templates: Analyst (data-heavy), Executive (summary-focused), Researcher (exploration)\\n- Save/load named layouts with thumbnails\\n- Auto-responsive layout adaptation per breakpoint\\n- Component visibility toggles (show/hide sections)\\n- Layout sharing via URL or export\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time collaborative layout editing\\n- Custom component creation (users work with existing view parts)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **LayoutEngine** - Core layout state management with grid system\\n2. **DraggableViewPanel** - Wrapper making any view component draggable/resizable\\n3. **LayoutBuilder** - UI for creating and editing layouts\\n4. **LayoutTemplateGallery** - Pre-built layout selection\\n5. **LayoutPersistence** - Save/load/share layout configurations\\n6. **ResponsiveLayoutAdapter** - Breakpoint-aware layout transformation\\n7. **ComponentRegistry** - Registry of all available view components\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use react-grid-layout for drag/drop and resize\\n- Store layouts as JSON schema: {id, grid: [{component, x, y, w, h}]}\\n- CSS Container Queries for responsive panels\\n- LocalStorage + cloud sync for persistence\\n- URL encoding for shareable layouts (base64 compressed)\\n- Lazy load components not in initial viewport\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutEngine.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/DraggableViewPanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutBuilder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/LayoutTemplateGallery.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/layout/ResponsiveLayoutAdapter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/layoutSchema.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useLayout.ts`\\n- Modify: All view files to be layout-aware\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx for layout mode integration\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Drag component to new position with smooth animation\\n- Resize panels with live preview\\n- Layout persists across sessions\\n- Mobile layout auto-adapts from desktop configuration\\n- Share layout via URL to colleague, they see same view\\n- Switch between 3+ saved layouts instantly\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Grid layout complexity on very small screens\\n- Performance with many draggable components\\n- Layout migration when component inventory changes\",\"summary\":\"Implement customizable view layouts with drag-and-drop composition, saved configurations, and responsive breakpoint optimization\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:45:35.108Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:45:35.108Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_name\":\"Report Views\",\"context_group_id\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-29T23:45:54.484Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01L5RUaamr6ak2te321Pcra6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017dyDNdBoLwG1nt1Sv1QqHu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Views\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Views\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build AI-powered insight synthesis with executive briefing generation, decision tree navigation, and what-if scenario modeling\",\n  \"direction\": \"## AI-Powered Insight Synthesis & Decision Support\\n\\n### Vision\\nAugment the report views with AI-powered synthesis that generates executive briefings, creates decision trees from research findings, and enables what-if scenario exploration. Transform raw research data into actionable intelligence tailored to the reader's decision context.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- 10x faster time-to-decision for executives\\n- Consistent high-quality synthesis regardless of research complexity\\n- Scenario modeling reveals non-obvious implications\\n- Differentiated feature that competitors lack\\n- Enables charging premium for AI-enhanced reports\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- One-click executive briefing generation (1-page summary)\\n- Decision tree visualization from findings (if X then Y implications)\\n- What-if scenario modeling (change assumptions, see impact)\\n- Key question identification (what should you ask next?)\\n- Confidence-weighted recommendations with justification\\n- Audio narration of briefing (text-to-speech)\\n- Briefing export to PDF/Slides\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time data updates (uses snapshot)\\n- Financial modeling (qualitative only)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **BriefingGenerator** - LLM-powered executive summary creation\\n2. **DecisionTreeBuilder** - Extract if-then relationships from findings\\n3. **DecisionTreeViz** - Interactive D3-based tree visualization\\n4. **ScenarioModeler** - What-if parameter adjustment UI\\n5. **ScenarioImpactAnalyzer** - Recalculate implications based on changed assumptions\\n6. **QuestionGenerator** - Identify gaps and next questions\\n7. **BriefingNarrator** - Text-to-speech for audio briefings\\n8. **BriefingExporter** - PDF and slide deck generation\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use structured prompting with Claude/GPT-4 for synthesis\\n- Cache generated briefings with findings hash for invalidation\\n- Decision trees: extract from contradictions and causal chains\\n- Scenario modeling: adjust confidence weights, propagate changes\\n- Use Web Speech API or ElevenLabs for narration\\n- Export via react-pdf or pptxgenjs\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/BriefingGenerator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/DecisionTreeBuilder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/DecisionTreeViz.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/ScenarioModeler.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/QuestionGenerator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/ai/BriefingNarrator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/aiSynthesis.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useAISynthesis.ts`\\n- Create: API route: `src/app/api/briefing/generate/route.ts`\\n- Modify: OverviewView.tsx - Add AI briefing toggle\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Generate 1-page briefing in <15 seconds\\n- Decision tree accurately reflects contradictions\\n- Scenario changes propagate to recommendations\\n- Audio narration plays smoothly\\n- PDF export is print-ready\\n- Users report faster decision-making in feedback\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- LLM hallucination in synthesis (need verification step)\\n- Latency for complex reports\\n- Audio voice quality and pacing\\n- Decision tree complexity with many findings\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Views direction 2"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2086,"cache_read_input_tokens":77717,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2086},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"fb6a9f4f-a775-487d-afd0-6777fbd63f9d"}
