se sections to include\\n7. **PrintStylesheet** - Print-optimized CSS\\n8. **ExportTemplates** - Pre-configured export formats\\n9. **WatermarkOverlay** - Confidentiality marking\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use @react-pdf/renderer for client-side PDF preview\\n- Puppeteer server-side for final PDF generation\\n- pptxgenjs for PowerPoint generation\\n- Store snapshots in R2 with signed URLs for expiry\\n- CSS @media print rules for browser print\\n- Templates as JSON schemas defining content blocks\\n- Track exports for analytics (which sections, formats)\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ExportConfigModal.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ContentSelector.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/BrandingEditor.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ExportTemplates.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/WatermarkOverlay.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/export/pdf/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/export/slides/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/snapshot/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/styles/print.css`\\n- Create: `src/lib/exportTemplates.ts`\\n- Modify: ReportToolbar.tsx - Add export button and dropdown\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- PDF generates in <30 seconds for average report\\n- PDF renders correctly with branding, TOC, page numbers\\n- Slides can be imported into PowerPoint/Google Slides\\n- Shareable links work and expire as configured\\n- Print from browser produces clean output\\n- Batch export handles 10 reports without issues\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- PDF rendering consistency across browsers\\n- Slide formatting for varied content lengths\\n- Large report memory usage during generation\\n- Watermark positioning over varied layouts\",\"summary\":\"Implement comprehensive print and export system with PDF reports, presentation decks, and shareable web snapshots\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:46:19.147Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:46:19.147Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_name\":\"Report Views\",\"context_group_id\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"956097ba-4b27-433c-bdfc-e6d0784bee15","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"success\":true,\"direction\":{\"id\":\"direction_d26ae4e7-e918-46a1-9f6d-56ccc877a652\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_map_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"context_map_title\":\"Report Views\",\"direction\":\"## Comprehensive Print & Export System\\n\\n### Vision\\nBuild a professional-grade export system that generates beautiful PDFs, presentation decks, and shareable web snapshots from any report view. Support branding customization, selective content inclusion, and multiple output formats optimized for different use cases.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Reports can be shared with stakeholders who don't have app access\\n- Professional PDF output suitable for board presentations\\n- Shareable links enable viral distribution of insights\\n- Branding customization makes reports client-ready\\n- Export analytics reveals most valuable content\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- PDF export with customizable branding (logo, colors, fonts)\\n- PowerPoint/Google Slides deck generation\\n- Shareable web snapshot with expiring links\\n- Selective content inclusion (choose which sections)\\n- Print-optimized CSS with proper page breaks\\n- Table of contents and page numbers\\n- Watermarking for confidential reports\\n- Export templates (Executive Brief, Full Report, Data Appendix)\\n- Batch export multiple reports\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Word document generation\\n- Real-time collaborative editing of exports\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **ExportConfigModal** - UI for selecting export options\\n2. **PDFGenerator** - Server-side PDF rendering with Puppeteer\\n3. **SlideGenerator** - Create presentation decks from findings\\n4. **WebSnapshotService** - Generate shareable static snapshots\\n5. **BrandingEditor** - Configure logo, colors, fonts\\n6. **ContentSelector** - Choose sections to include\\n7. **PrintStylesheet** - Print-optimized CSS\\n8. **ExportTemplates** - Pre-configured export formats\\n9. **WatermarkOverlay** - Confidentiality marking\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use @react-pdf/renderer for client-side PDF preview\\n- Puppeteer server-side for final PDF generation\\n- pptxgenjs for PowerPoint generation\\n- Store snapshots in R2 with signed URLs for expiry\\n- CSS @media print rules for browser print\\n- Templates as JSON schemas defining content blocks\\n- Track exports for analytics (which sections, formats)\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ExportConfigModal.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ContentSelector.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/BrandingEditor.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/ExportTemplates.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/export/WatermarkOverlay.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/export/pdf/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/export/slides/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/snapshot/route.ts`\\n- Create: `src/styles/print.css`\\n- Create: `src/lib/exportTemplates.ts`\\n- Modify: ReportToolbar.tsx - Add export button and dropdown\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- PDF generates in <30 seconds for average report\\n- PDF renders correctly with branding, TOC, page numbers\\n- Slides can be imported into PowerPoint/Google Slides\\n- Shareable links work and expire as configured\\n- Print from browser produces clean output\\n- Batch export handles 10 reports without issues\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- PDF rendering consistency across browsers\\n- Slide formatting for varied content lengths\\n- Large report memory usage during generation\\n- Watermark positioning over varied layouts\",\"summary\":\"Implement comprehensive print and export system with PDF reports, presentatio