[2026-01-29T23:47:07.409Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01BG5dh7CvWjYdHGRsnZFP7G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MvqtQUDQn9zgE3rJWqzabe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build comprehensive command palette and keyboard navigation system with vim-style shortcuts and voice control\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Command Palette & Power User Navigation System\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the report shell into a keyboard-first experience with a Spotlight/Alfred-style command palette. Power users can navigate, filter, export, and take actions entirely via keyboard. Support vim-style navigation modes for ultra-fast document traversal.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- 3-5x faster navigation for keyboard-oriented users\\n- Accessibility compliance (WCAG keyboard navigation)\\n- Power user retention through professional-grade UX\\n- Reduced mouse repetitive strain\\n- Differentiation from competitors with slower UIs\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Command palette (Cmd+K) with fuzzy search across all actions\\n- Vim-style navigation mode (j/k scroll, gg/G to top/bottom)\\n- Tab switching via number keys (1=Overview, 2=Findings, etc.)\\n- Quick filters via keyboard shortcuts (f for filter menu)\\n- Jump to finding/source by ID\\n- Keyboard shortcut cheatsheet (? to show)\\n- Focus management across all interactive elements\\n- Voice command integration (optional, via Web Speech API)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full vim command language\\n- Custom keybinding editor (future enhancement)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **CommandPalette** - Searchable action launcher with fuzzy matching\\n2. **KeyboardNavigator** - Manages focus and keyboard shortcuts\\n3. **VimMode** - Optional vim-style navigation layer\\n4. **ShortcutRegistry** - Central shortcut registration and conflict detection\\n5. **ShortcutCheatsheet** - Visual overlay showing all shortcuts\\n6. **FocusRing** - Visual indicator for current focus\\n7. **VoiceCommandParser** - Speech-to-action integration\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use React hotkeys-hook for shortcut handling\\n- Command palette: fuse.js for fuzzy matching actions\\n- Focus trap for modal contexts\\n- Vim mode: state machine for modal commands (normal/insert)\\n- Store shortcut preferences in localStorage\\n- Voice: Web Speech API with command grammar\\n- Event delegation for performance\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/CommandPalette.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/KeyboardNavigator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/VimMode.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/ShortcutCheatsheet.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/VoiceCommands.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/shortcutRegistry.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useKeyboardNavigation.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useVoiceCommands.ts`\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx - Integrate keyboard navigator\\n- Modify: ReportView.tsx - Add command palette trigger\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Cmd+K opens palette in <50ms\\n- Navigate entire report without mouse\\n- Vim j/k scrolls smoothly\\n- Tab numbers switch views instantly\\n- ? shows all available shortcuts\\n- Voice commands recognized >90% accuracy\\n- No focus traps or keyboard dead ends\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Browser shortcut conflicts (Cmd+P for print)\\n- Focus management during dynamic content\\n- Vim mode learning curve for non-vim users\\n- Voice recognition in noisy environments\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Shell direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5483,"cache_read_input_tokens":89573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5483},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"bd600994-7779-4dad-8855-4c3855ef2b12"}
