indicator for current focus\\n7. **VoiceCommandParser** - Speech-to-action integration\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use React hotkeys-hook for shortcut handling\\n- Command palette: fuse.js for fuzzy matching actions\\n- Focus trap for modal contexts\\n- Vim mode: state machine for modal commands (normal/insert)\\n- Store shortcut preferences in localStorage\\n- Voice: Web Speech API with command grammar\\n- Event delegation for performance\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/CommandPalette.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/KeyboardNavigator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/VimMode.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/ShortcutCheatsheet.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/navigation/VoiceCommands.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/shortcutRegistry.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useKeyboardNavigation.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useVoiceCommands.ts`\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx - Integrate keyboard navigator\\n- Modify: ReportView.tsx - Add command palette trigger\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Cmd+K opens palette in <50ms\\n- Navigate entire report without mouse\\n- Vim j/k scrolls smoothly\\n- Tab numbers switch views instantly\\n- ? shows all available shortcuts\\n- Voice commands recognized >90% accuracy\\n- No focus traps or keyboard dead ends\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Browser shortcut conflicts (Cmd+P for print)\\n- Focus management during dynamic content\\n- Vim mode learning curve for non-vim users\\n- Voice recognition in noisy environments\",\"summary\":\"Build comprehensive command palette and keyboard navigation system with vim-style shortcuts and voice control\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"requirement_id\":null,\"requirement_path\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:47:08.386Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-29T23:47:08.386Z\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\"context_name\":\"Report Shell & Navigation\",\"context_group_id\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":