[2026-01-29T23:47:25.444Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01FkDkGk8c3SyDRyMYHnk5um","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ey9QcH88oTbKRiasnqWi4X","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement multi-report workspace with split views, tabbed interface, and cross-report comparison capabilities\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Multi-Report Workspace with Split Views\\n\\n### Vision\\nEnable users to work with multiple reports simultaneously in a tabbed, splittable workspace. Compare findings across reports side-by-side, track related research threads, and maintain context when switching between investigations.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Essential for comparative analysis workflows\\n- Enables due diligence across multiple companies\\n- Reduces context-switching cognitive load\\n- Supports professional research workflows\\n- Premium feature potential for enterprise\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Tabbed report interface (open multiple reports)\\n- Split view (2-4 panes horizontal/vertical)\\n- Cross-report search (search across all open reports)\\n- Linked scrolling for comparison\\n- Report pinning (keep important reports accessible)\\n- Workspace save/restore (remember open reports and layout)\\n- Drag-and-drop tab reordering\\n- Tab groups by project/investigation\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time collaborative multi-user workspaces\\n- Report merging/consolidation\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **WorkspaceManager** - State management for multi-report workspace\\n2. **ReportTabBar** - Horizontal tabs with drag-and-drop\\n3. **SplitPaneContainer** - Resizable split views\\n4. **CrossReportSearch** - Unified search across all open reports\\n5. **LinkedScrollController** - Synchronize scroll across panes\\n6. **WorkspacePersistence** - Save/load workspace configurations\\n7. **TabGrouping** - Organize tabs by project\\n8. **ComparisonHighlighter** - Highlight differences across reports\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use Zustand for workspace state management\\n- react-resizable-panels for split panes\\n- @dnd-kit for tab drag-and-drop\\n- IndexedDB for workspace persistence (reports can be large)\\n- Virtualized tab bar for 10+ open reports\\n- Intersection Observer for linked scrolling\\n- URL encoding for shareable workspace state\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/WorkspaceContainer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/ReportTabBar.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/SplitPaneContainer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/CrossReportSearch.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/TabGroup.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/workspace/ComparisonHighlighter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/stores/workspaceStore.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useWorkspace.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useLinkedScroll.ts`\\n- Modify: ReportShell.tsx - Support workspace embedding\\n- Modify: App layout - Add workspace container\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Open 5+ reports in tabs without performance degradation\\n- Split view maintains independent scroll/filter state\\n- Linked scroll stays synchronized within 50ms\\n- Workspace saves and restores correctly\\n- Cross-report search returns results from all open reports\\n- Tab drag-and-drop feels native\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Memory usage with many open reports\\n- State isolation between split panes\\n- Linked scroll performance with large documents\\n- Deep linking workspace state in URL\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Shell direction 2"}}],"stop_reason":null,"st