[2026-01-29T23:47:48.144Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011uob4RDbtpcSBCFXYmo1SM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019wFFaHKnPYhhLEGvFN8JP2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727785209_4e0hko7\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Report Shell & Navigation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build adaptive sidebar with AI-driven content recommendations, contextual actions, and collapsible quick-access panels\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Adaptive Sidebar with AI-Driven Recommendations\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the sidebar from static navigation into an intelligent assistant that surfaces relevant content based on what the user is viewing, suggests related findings, highlights items needing attention, and provides contextual actions. The sidebar adapts to user behavior and current focus.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Surfaces insights users might miss through passive browsing\\n- Reduces time to find related information\\n- Proactive alerts prevent oversight of critical findings\\n- Personalized experience increases engagement\\n- AI-driven features justify premium pricing\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Contextual recommendations panel (related to current view)\\n- Smart alerts (contradictions involving current finding, etc.)\\n- Recently viewed quick-access list\\n- Pinned items across sessions\\n- Collapsible sidebar sections with memory\\n- AI-suggested next actions based on context\\n- Quick stats that update based on filtered view\\n- Sidebar search for fast jumping\\n- Mini-map visualization of report structure\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Learning user preferences across sessions (use simple heuristics)\\n- Natural language sidebar queries\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **AdaptiveSidebar** - Main container with context awareness\\n2. **RecommendationsPanel** - AI-driven related content suggestions\\n3. **SmartAlertsWidget** - Contextual warnings and attention items\\n4. **RecentlyViewedList** - Quick access to viewed items\\n5. **PinnedItemsPanel** - User-pinned findings/sources\\n6. **SidebarMiniMap** - Visual overview of report structure\\n7. **ContextualActionsMenu** - Actions relevant to current view\\n8. **SidebarSearch** - Quick jump search within sidebar\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Context provider tracks current view, selection, scroll position\\n- Recommendations: vector similarity on findings (pre-computed embeddings)\\n- Alerts: filter contradictions/gaps related to current focus\\n- Recently viewed: localStorage with LRU eviction\\n- Mini-map: canvas-based rendering for performance\\n- Collapsible sections: persist state in localStorage\\n- Actions: registry pattern with context predicates\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/AdaptiveSidebar.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/RecommendationsPanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/SmartAlertsWidget.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/RecentlyViewedList.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/PinnedItemsPanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/SidebarMiniMap.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/sidebar/ContextualActions.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/recommendationEngine.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useViewContext.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useSidebarState.ts`\\n- Modify: ThemedSidebar.tsx - Integrate adaptive panels\\n- Modify: ReportView.tsx - Provide view context\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Recommendations update within 200ms of context change\\n- Related findings are genuinely relevant (user feedback positive)\\n- Alerts surface items user would want to know about\\n- Recently viewed persists across browser sessions\\n- Pinned items accessible in <2 clicks\\n- Mini-map accurately represents document structure\\n- Sidebar search finds items in <100ms\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Recommendation relevance without heavy ML\\n- Mini-map performance for large documents\\n- Alert fatigue if too many notifications\\n- Balancing density with usability\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Report Shell direction 3"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2134,"cache_read_input_tokens":97266,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2134},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"2d1affb8-20a5-4628-aae0-45ee1abbd550"}
