[2026-01-29T23:48:28.746Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011B1FpQBa3Auf69fG6DtYNB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EU5k9nG9y5cxpdD2FgkVQg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build immersive 3D research galaxy with WebGL visualization, spatial clustering, and VR/AR exploration support\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Immersive 3D Research Galaxy Visualization\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a breathtaking 3D visualization where research sessions become stars in a navigable galaxy. Templates form constellations, topics create nebulae, and relationships appear as gravitational connections. Support WebXR for VR headset exploration.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Unique differentiation from any competitor\\n- Viral marketing through stunning visuals\\n- Enables intuitive understanding of large research collections\\n- VR/AR support positions product for future workflows\\n- Premium feature that justifies higher pricing\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- 3D WebGL galaxy visualization using Three.js\\n- Spatial clustering by template/topic/time\\n- Fly-through navigation with smooth transitions\\n- Session details on hover with 3D tooltip\\n- Star brightness based on findings count\\n- Gravitational lines showing relationships\\n- Time slider to animate research history\\n- Screenshot/video capture of current view\\n- WebXR support for VR exploration\\n- Minimap for orientation\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Collaborative multi-user VR\\n- Physics-based interactions\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **GalaxyScene** - Three.js scene setup with camera controls\\n2. **StarField** - Instanced mesh rendering for session stars\\n3. **ConstellationLines** - Template/topic grouping visualizations\\n4. **FlyThroughCamera** - Smooth navigation controller\\n5. **Star3DTooltip** - Floating info panel for hovered sessions\\n6. **TimeWarpSlider** - Temporal navigation through research history\\n7. **GalaxyMinimap** - 2D overview for orientation\\n8. **WebXRController** - VR headset integration\\n9. **ScreenshotCapture** - Export current view as image/video\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Three.js with postprocessing for bloom/glow effects\\n- Instanced rendering for 1000+ sessions without lag\\n- Octree spatial indexing for efficient raycasting\\n- TWEEN.js for smooth camera transitions\\n- dat.gui for debug controls during development\\n- WebXR API for VR support\\n- RecordRTC for video capture\\n- RequestAnimationFrame with framerate limiting\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/GalaxyScene.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/StarField.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/ConstellationLines.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/FlyThroughCamera.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/GalaxyMinimap.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/WebXRController.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/galaxy/TimeWarpSlider.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/galaxyLayout.ts` - Spatial positioning algorithms\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useGalaxyControls.ts`\\n- Modify: visualizations/index.tsx - Export galaxy components\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- 60fps rendering with 500+ sessions\\n- Navigate from overview to single session smoothly\\n- VR mode works on Quest/Vision Pro\\n- Constellation groupings match template structure\\n- Time slider animates research history\\n- Screenshot captures high-res image\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- WebGL performance on low-end devices\\n- VR motion sickness prevention\\n- Spatial layout algorithm complexity\\n- Mobile device GPU limitations\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Alternative Views direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13668,"cache_read_input_tokens":102161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13668},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"eaf19aa2-4d4b-4337-9db2-3e7cf24616cc"}
