[2026-01-29T23:48:48.912Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_019GUoFvyPP9uk1EG5CoDh4w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CLB44zRaErEwjKzygBZoDY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"summary\": \"Create magazine-style reading view with editorial layouts, typography focus, and print-ready article formatting\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Magazine-Style Editorial Reading View\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a beautiful editorial reading experience that presents research as polished magazine articles. Focus on typography, whitespace, and visual hierarchy to make long-form research a pleasure to read. Support print-ready formatting for physical distribution.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Professional presentation for client deliverables\\n- Differentiates from sterile data-focused competitors\\n- Print capability enables offline sharing\\n- Reading-focused design reduces cognitive load\\n- Appeals to executives who prefer narrative format\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Magazine-style multi-column layouts\\n- Professional typography with custom font pairings\\n- Pull quotes from key findings\\n- Infographic integration within article flow\\n- Image/chart placement with captions\\n- Table of contents with jump links\\n- Reading progress indicator\\n- Estimated read time\\n- Print stylesheet with page breaks\\n- Reader mode (no chrome, full focus)\\n- Font size and spacing controls\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Custom article templates designer\\n- Collaborative annotations (separate feature)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **MagazineLayout** - Multi-column responsive grid system\\n2. **EditorialHeader** - Hero section with title and metadata\\n3. **ArticleBody** - Typography-focused content renderer\\n4. **PullQuote** - Styled callout for key insights\\n5. **InlineInfoGraphic** - Chart/visualization within text flow\\n6. **TableOfContents** - Floating navigation for long articles\\n7. **ReadingProgress** - Scroll-based progress indicator\\n8. **ReaderModeToggle** - Distraction-free reading switch\\n9. **PrintLayout** - Print-optimized stylesheet\\n10. **TypographyControls** - Font, size, spacing adjustments\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- CSS Grid for magazine column layouts\\n- Variable fonts for weight/width control (Inter, Source Serif)\\n- Intersection Observer for reading progress\\n- CSS @media print rules with @page directives\\n- Local Storage for typography preferences\\n- Markdown-to-article transformation pipeline\\n- Automatic pull quote extraction from high-confidence findings\\n- Image lazy loading with blur placeholder\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/MagazineLayout.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/EditorialHeader.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/ArticleBody.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/PullQuote.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/InlineInfoGraphic.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/TableOfContents.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/magazine/TypographyControls.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/styles/magazine.css` - Magazine-specific styles\\n- Create: `src/styles/magazine-print.css` - Print stylesheet\\n- Create: `src/lib/articleTransformer.ts` - Research to article conversion\\n- Modify: visualizations/index.tsx - Export magazine view\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Article renders with professional magazine quality\\n- Pull quotes automatically extracted from findings\\n- Print produces clean, readable pages\\n- Reading progress tracks accurately\\n- Reader mode hides all UI\\n- Typography controls persist across sessions\\n- Multi-column layout adapts to viewport\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Column balancing with variable content\\n- Print page break positioning\\n- Chart sizing within column constraints\\n- Font loading performance\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Alternative Views direction 2"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2293,"cache_read_input_tokens":115829,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2293},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"d833312a-47b2-4d96-988d-29a4ae75ba98"}
