[2026-01-29T23:49:08.953Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01SwVXp7hWfM5mNX6tftX9ek","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J9CQHhDsY3CVTFhfXCf1qg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727820397_lpufsga\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Alternative Research Views\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement interactive knowledge map with semantic clustering, zoom-to-detail, and AI-powered insight discovery paths\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Interactive Knowledge Map with Semantic Discovery\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate an interactive knowledge map that organizes research not by arbitrary categories but by semantic relationships. Use embeddings to cluster related findings, create discovery paths that guide users through connected insights, and enable AI-powered zoom-to-detail exploration.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Reveals hidden connections human categorization misses\\n- Accelerates insight discovery through guided exploration\\n- Creates aha moments that increase perceived value\\n- Supports serendipitous discovery of related research\\n- Enables question-driven navigation\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Semantic clustering using finding embeddings\\n- Zoomable map with progressive detail (overview -> cluster -> finding)\\n- Discovery paths: AI-suggested exploration routes\\n- Question-driven navigation (ask what you want to find)\\n- Similarity halos showing related items\\n- Cluster labels generated from common themes\\n- Bookmarkable map positions\\n- Path history and breadcrumbs\\n- Export discovery path as narrative\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Custom embedding training\\n- Real-time collaborative exploration\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **KnowledgeMap** - Main zoomable container with semantic layout\\n2. **SemanticCluster** - Grouped findings with generated label\\n3. **ZoomController** - Semantic zoom with detail levels\\n4. **DiscoveryPathDrawer** - Visualize and follow suggested paths\\n5. **QuestionNavigator** - Natural language map search\\n6. **SimilarityHalo** - Highlight related items on hover\\n7. **ClusterLabeler** - AI-generated cluster names\\n8. **PathExporter** - Export discovery journey as document\\n9. **MapBookmarks** - Save and restore map positions\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Use UMAP/t-SNE for embedding dimensionality reduction (pre-computed)\\n- Force-directed layout within clusters for spacing\\n- Canvas rendering for performance at scale\\n- Vector search for question navigation\\n- LLM for cluster label generation (batched)\\n- Smooth zoom with D3-zoom or similar\\n- URL encoding for shareable map positions\\n- Local Storage for bookmarks\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/KnowledgeMap.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/SemanticCluster.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/ZoomController.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/DiscoveryPathDrawer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/QuestionNavigator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/SimilarityHalo.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/visualizations/knowledge-map/MapBookmarks.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/semanticLayout.ts` - UMAP/clustering algorithms\\n- Create: `src/lib/discoveryPaths.ts` - Path generation logic\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useKnowledgeMap.ts`\\n- Create: API route: `src/app/api/cluster-labels/route.ts`\\n- Modify: visualizations/index.tsx - Export knowledge map\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Related findings cluster together visually\\n- Zoom reveals detail progressively\\n- AI-suggested paths lead to relevant discoveries\\n- Question navigation finds relevant map areas\\n- Similarity halos highlight related items accurately\\n- Cluster labels are meaningful and descriptive\\n- Map state shareable via URL\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Embedding computation cost for large datasets\\n- Cluster labeling quality and consistency\\n- Layout stability when zooming\\n- Question-to-embedding matching accuracy\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Alternative Views direction 3"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2236,"cache_read_input_tokens":118122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2236},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"fa9bfb0f-c47b-4800-9a94-454ff7b31699"}
