[2026-01-29T23:49:54.142Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01BxMUf85UBii3n4in3nrzMv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017czhtYSQtgmo4HFs6sJPyi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727817888_ntez6a3\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Video Report Generation\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727817888_ntez6a3\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Video Report Generation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build server-side video rendering pipeline with Remotion for MP4 export, thumbnail generation, and social media optimization\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Server-Side Video Rendering Pipeline with Remotion\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the preview-only video system into a full production pipeline that renders actual MP4 videos server-side. Enable one-click export for YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, and LinkedIn with platform-specific optimizations, automatic thumbnail generation, and batch rendering.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Users can share research as viral video content\\n- Social media distribution expands reach dramatically\\n- Automated video generation saves hours vs manual creation\\n- Platform-optimized exports maximize engagement\\n- Premium feature with clear monetization path\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Server-side rendering using Remotion\\n- MP4 export with H.264 encoding\\n- Platform presets: YouTube (16:9), TikTok/Reels (9:16), LinkedIn (1:1)\\n- Automatic thumbnail generation at key frames\\n- Subtitle/caption generation with burn-in option\\n- Background music integration (royalty-free library)\\n- Batch rendering queue with progress tracking\\n- Video asset management (storage, expiry, download)\\n- Render quality settings (draft, standard, HQ)\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Custom video template editor\\n- AI voiceover (separate feature)\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **RemotionComposition** - Video composition definitions for Remotion\\n2. **RenderJobQueue** - Job queue for background rendering\\n3. **RenderProgressTracker** - WebSocket-based progress updates\\n4. **ThumbnailGenerator** - Extract frames at key moments\\n5. **SubtitleBurner** - Generate and burn-in captions\\n6. **MusicSelector** - Royalty-free background music integration\\n7. **PlatformPresets** - Platform-specific encoding settings\\n8. **VideoAssetManager** - Storage, retrieval, expiry management\\n9. **BatchRenderUI** - Queue multiple videos for rendering\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Remotion for React-based video composition\\n- AWS Lambda or Cloud Run for serverless rendering\\n- FFmpeg for encoding and subtitle burn-in\\n- R2/S3 for video storage with signed URLs\\n- Bull/BullMQ for render job queue\\n- WebSocket for real-time progress\\n- whisper.cpp or similar for auto-subtitles\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/remotion/` directory with compositions\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/ExportDialog.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/RenderProgress.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/ThumbnailPicker.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/MusicSelector.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/app/api/render/route.ts` - Initiate render\\n- Create: `src/app/api/render/[jobId]/route.ts` - Job status\\n- Create: `serverless/render-worker/` - Rendering service\\n- Create: `src/lib/renderQueue.ts`\\n- Modify: VideoOverview.tsx - Add export button\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- 15-second video renders in <60 seconds\\n- MP4 plays correctly on all platforms\\n- Thumbnails capture compelling frames\\n- Subtitles are accurate and well-timed\\n- Progress updates in real-time\\n- Batch render handles 10+ videos\\n- Video downloads work on mobile\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Serverless cold start affecting render time\\n- Memory limits for long videos\\n- Subtitle timing synchronization\\n- Cost management for rendering at scale\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Video Report direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6338,"cache_read_input_tokens":123455,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6338},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"1f38ab8c-9f2d-4cfc-8e94-3b71d450abfc"}
