[2026-01-29T23:50:32.594Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_015XEkfpScvkcsRsZSjDnzut","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E8LkziL695cM86eqEqcrck","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727817888_ntez6a3\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Video Report Generation\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727817888_ntez6a3\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Video Report Generation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Create visual template library with template editor, branded themes, and user-customizable scene compositions\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Visual Template Library & Editor\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a library of professionally designed video templates and a visual editor for customization. Users can choose from templates optimized for different content types (financial, investigative, technical), apply their brand colors and logos, and create reusable custom templates.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Professional output without design skills\\n- Brand consistency across all video content\\n- Template marketplace opportunity (user-created templates)\\n- Faster video creation with presets\\n- Agency use case: create templates for clients\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Template library: 10+ professional templates\\n- Template categories: Financial, Investigative, Technical, Executive, Casual\\n- Visual template editor with drag-and-drop\\n- Brand kit: colors, logo, fonts\\n- Scene customization: reorder, add/remove, duration\\n- Animation style presets: minimal, energetic, corporate\\n- Save custom templates\\n- Template preview with sample data\\n- Import/export template definitions\\n- Template versioning\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full motion graphics editor (After Effects level)\\n- Template marketplace with payments\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **TemplateGallery** - Browse and preview templates\\n2. **TemplateEditor** - Visual customization interface\\n3. **BrandKitManager** - Colors, logo, font configuration\\n4. **SceneArranger** - Drag-and-drop scene reordering\\n5. **AnimationStylePicker** - Choose animation presets\\n6. **SceneCustomizer** - Per-scene visual options\\n7. **TemplatePreview** - Live preview with sample data\\n8. **TemplateExporter** - Save/share template definitions\\n9. **CustomTemplateLibrary** - User's saved templates\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Template schema: JSON definition with scene config\\n- Design tokens for brand customization\\n- Framer Motion for animation orchestration\\n- Canvas preview for performance\\n- IndexedDB for local template storage\\n- Cloud sync for templates across devices\\n- Template validation schema\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/TemplateGallery.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/TemplateEditor.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/BrandKitManager.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/SceneArranger.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/AnimationStylePicker.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/SceneCustomizer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/video/templates/TemplatePreview.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/templateSchema.ts` - Template definition schema\\n- Create: `src/lib/templateLibrary.ts` - Built-in templates\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTemplateEditor.ts`\\n- Modify: VideoOverview.tsx - Template selection integration\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- 10+ templates available at launch\\n- Brand kit applies consistently across templates\\n- Scene reordering reflects in preview immediately\\n- Custom templates save and load correctly\\n- Template export produces portable definition\\n- Editor is intuitive for non-designers\\n- Preview renders at interactive framerates\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Template schema flexibility vs complexity\\n- Brand color application across varied designs\\n- Animation timing preservation when scenes reorder\\n- Performance with complex template previews\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Video Report direction 3"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2291,"cache_read_input_tokens":132100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2291},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"d2dcbe92-8452-4a2a-baa8-54e860632211"}
