[2026-01-29T23:51:13.033Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01TsWwoYk5dG1FcMGE7f93Uf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bo8b88pskA4vH2AnKcFjGn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build interactive multi-track timeline with zoom levels, event clustering, and parallel storyline visualization\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Interactive Multi-Track Timeline with Event Clustering\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the simple linear timeline into a powerful multi-track visualization that shows parallel storylines, supports semantic zoom from decades to days, clusters dense events intelligently, and enables users to trace how different threads of research interconnect over time.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Critical for understanding complex narratives (investigations, market evolution)\\n- Reveals patterns invisible in linear timelines\\n- Supports comparative analysis across time periods\\n- Professional-grade tool for researchers and analysts\\n- Differentiates from basic timeline tools\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Multi-track lanes for different event categories/entities\\n- Semantic zoom: decade -> year -> month -> day views\\n- Event clustering when too dense to display individually\\n- Swimlane layout for parallel storylines\\n- Time range selection with brush\\n- Compare two time periods side-by-side\\n- Event connections showing cause-effect across time\\n- Milestone markers for significant events\\n- Period annotations (eras, phases)\\n- Mini-map for orientation in long timelines\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Gantt chart editing capabilities\\n- Calendar integration\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **MultiTrackTimeline** - Main container with track management\\n2. **TimelineTrack** - Individual swimlane for event category\\n3. **SemanticZoomController** - Zoom level management\\n4. **EventClusterNode** - Collapsed view of dense events\\n5. **TimeRangeBrush** - Selection tool for time periods\\n6. **CrossTimeConnections** - Lines showing event relationships\\n7. **PeriodAnnotations** - Era/phase markers\\n8. **TimelineMinimap** - Overview navigation\\n9. **ComparePeriods** - Side-by-side time comparison\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- D3.js for timeline axis and zooming\\n- Temporal clustering algorithm (DBSCAN on time dimension)\\n- Canvas rendering for performance with many events\\n- Intersection Observer for lazy loading events\\n- RequestAnimationFrame for smooth zoom transitions\\n- URL state for shareable zoom/position\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/MultiTrackTimeline.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/TimelineTrack.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/SemanticZoomController.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/EventClusterNode.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/TimeRangeBrush.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/timeline/CrossTimeConnections.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/temporalClustering.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useTimelineZoom.ts`\\n- Modify: Timeline.tsx - Upgrade to use new components\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- 1000+ events render without lag\\n- Zoom from year to day feels smooth\\n- Clusters expand on click to show contents\\n- Multiple tracks align correctly\\n- Time range selection works intuitively\\n- Cross-time connections show clearly\\n- Minimap reflects current position\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Performance with many overlapping events\\n- Cluster threshold tuning for clarity\\n- Cross-track connection routing\\n- Responsive layout for narrow viewports\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Timeline direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4686,"cache_read_input_tokens":137059,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4686},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"28649b41-dff7-4e15-b88c-27ccd70ddae7"}
