[2026-01-29T23:51:31.990Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01HKDvWqCWDfHbG5eM6RMvEw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JyKMFTL3rk7YY9uUrCtmg6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implement interactive Sankey and causal chain editor with drag-and-drop flow building and what-if analysis\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Interactive Causal Flow Editor with What-If Analysis\\n\\n### Vision\\nTransform the static causal flow visualization into an interactive editor where users can explore, modify, and test causal relationships. Add Sankey diagram support for flow magnitude visualization and enable what-if analysis by adjusting chain parameters.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Critical for scenario planning and risk assessment\\n- Enables active exploration vs passive viewing\\n- What-if analysis supports decision-making\\n- Sankey diagrams show relative importance of flows\\n- Interactive editing creates engagement\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Sankey diagram mode showing flow magnitudes\\n- Drag-and-drop causal chain editing\\n- Add/remove/reorder chain steps\\n- What-if sliders to adjust step weights\\n- Impact propagation visualization\\n- Alternative path highlighting\\n- Chain comparison (compare two scenarios)\\n- Export chain as shareable diagram\\n- Automatic layout optimization\\n- Confidence visualization on edges\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full process modeling (BPMN-level)\\n- Quantitative simulation\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **SankeyDiagram** - Flow magnitude visualization\\n2. **EditableCausalChain** - Interactive chain with drag-and-drop\\n3. **ChainStepEditor** - Modify individual step properties\\n4. **WhatIfControls** - Parameter adjustment sliders\\n5. **ImpactPropagation** - Visual ripple effect for changes\\n6. **AlternativePathHighlighter** - Show branching possibilities\\n7. **ChainComparator** - Side-by-side scenario comparison\\n8. **AutoLayoutEngine** - Optimize node positions\\n9. **ChainExporter** - Export as image or JSON\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- D3-sankey for Sankey diagram layout\\n- @dnd-kit for drag-and-drop editing\\n- React Flow or custom SVG for chain visualization\\n- Dagre or ELK for automatic layout\\n- Optimistic UI updates during editing\\n- URL state for shareable configurations\\n- Canvas export via html2canvas\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/SankeyDiagram.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/EditableCausalChain.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/ChainStepEditor.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/WhatIfControls.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/ImpactPropagation.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/flow/ChainComparator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/causalLayout.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useCausalEditor.ts`\\n- Modify: CausalFlow.tsx - Integrate editable mode\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Sankey diagram accurately shows flow magnitudes\\n- Drag-and-drop reordering works smoothly\\n- What-if changes propagate visually\\n- Layout stays clean during editing\\n- Comparison mode shows differences clearly\\n- Export produces high-quality image\\n- Undo/redo works for all edits\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Layout stability during drag operations\\n- Sankey calculation for complex chains\\n- What-if propagation logic complexity\\n- Performance with many parallel chains\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Timeline direction 2"}}],"s