[2026-01-29T23:51:51.250Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01RYWcRAQNqMXeYgu3th12oh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NdY9bwfJuo6zqyZvckqUWA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727813930_04t57vz\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Timeline & Flow Visualizations\",\n  \"summary\": \"Create animated story mode with auto-narrated timeline playback and exportable video timeline summaries\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Animated Story Mode with Timeline Playback\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a story mode that animates through the timeline like a documentary, auto-narrating key events and creating a compelling narrative from research data. Export as video or interactive presentation.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Makes research accessible to non-analyst stakeholders\\n- Creates shareable content for presentations\\n- Documentary-style delivery increases engagement\\n- Supports executive briefings\\n- Premium feature for storytelling needs\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Animated timeline playback with smooth transitions\\n- Auto-generated narration script from events\\n- Pause/play/seek controls\\n- Speed adjustment (0.5x - 3x)\\n- Chapter markers for key periods\\n- Event highlight animations\\n- Context cards that appear at events\\n- Export as video or animated GIF\\n- Interactive presentation mode\\n- Background music with event-synced cues\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Full video editing (cuts, transitions between scenes)\\n- Custom narration recording\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **StoryModePlayer** - Main playback container\\n2. **TimelineAnimator** - Controls timeline progression\\n3. **EventHighlighter** - Animation when event appears\\n4. **ContextCard** - Info cards for events\\n5. **NarrationGenerator** - AI script from events\\n6. **ChapterNavigator** - Jump between key periods\\n7. **PlaybackControls** - Play/pause/speed/seek\\n8. **StoryExporter** - Export to video/GIF\\n9. **MusicSynchronizer** - Background music integration\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- RequestAnimationFrame for smooth playback\\n- AI (Claude/GPT) for narration script generation\\n- Web Speech API or TTS for narration audio\\n- RecordRTC for video capture\\n- Tone.js for music synchronization\\n- Chapter detection via event clustering\\n- GSAP or Framer Motion for animations\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/StoryModePlayer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/TimelineAnimator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/EventHighlighter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/ContextCard.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/NarrationGenerator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/ChapterNavigator.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/PlaybackControls.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/story/StoryExporter.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/storyScript.ts` - Script generation\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useStoryPlayback.ts`\\n- Modify: Timeline.tsx - Add story mode toggle\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Playback feels smooth and cinematic\\n- Narration naturally describes events\\n- Context cards provide relevant information\\n- Chapters break story into logical segments\\n- Export produces watchable video\\n- Interactive mode allows exploration during playback\\n- Music enhances without distracting\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Narration timing with variable event density\\n- Cinematic pacing for uneven data\\n- Video export performance and quality\\n- Music licensing for exports\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Timeline direction 3"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2226,"cache_read_input_tokens":143945,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2226},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"22bf7687-bde7-499d-8a06-2fd9df97dac8"}
