[2026-01-29T23:52:27.388Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01C7c9LMxXttzo4EPCWkUYdu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018yj1D9bZ6fNkqQs96t1V6V","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727810613_2jnuwma\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Trust & Confidence Visualizations\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727810613_2jnuwma\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Trust & Confidence Visualizations\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build comprehensive source credibility analysis dashboard with factor breakdown, historical tracking, and benchmark comparisons\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Source Credibility Analysis Dashboard\\n\\n### Vision\\nCreate a comprehensive dashboard that breaks down source credibility into multiple factors, tracks how credibility assessments change over time, compares sources against industry benchmarks, and provides actionable insights for improving research quality.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Transparency builds user trust in research methodology\\n- Factor breakdown helps users understand credibility scoring\\n- Historical tracking shows research evolution\\n- Benchmarking provides objective quality standards\\n- Differentiates from black-box credibility scores\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Multi-factor credibility breakdown (authority, recency, corroboration, bias)\\n- Source credibility trends over time\\n- Industry benchmark comparisons\\n- Source quality distribution analysis\\n- Weak source identification and recommendations\\n- Source clustering by credibility profile\\n- Export credibility report\\n- Drill-down from aggregate to individual sources\\n- Credibility threshold configuration\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time source verification\\n- Custom credibility factor weighting\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **CredibilityFactorBreakdown** - Stacked bar showing factor contributions\\n2. **CredibilityTrendChart** - Line chart of credibility over time/sessions\\n3. **BenchmarkComparison** - Sources vs industry standards\\n4. **SourceQualityDistribution** - Histogram of credibility scores\\n5. **WeakSourcePanel** - Flagged sources needing attention\\n6. **CredibilityClusterMap** - Sources grouped by profile\\n7. **CredibilityReportExporter** - Generate credibility PDF\\n8. **SourceDrillDown** - Individual source details\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Recharts for visualization components\\n- Factor weighting configurable via context\\n- Historical data from session metadata\\n- Benchmark data from aggregated research corpus\\n- Clustering via k-means on factor vectors\\n- PDF generation with react-pdf\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/CredibilityDashboard.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/FactorBreakdown.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/CredibilityTrend.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/BenchmarkComparison.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/QualityDistribution.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/credibility/WeakSourcePanel.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/credibilityFactors.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useCredibilityAnalysis.ts`\\n- Modify: TrustRadar.tsx - Link to dashboard\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Factor breakdown sums to total credibility\\n- Trend chart shows meaningful patterns\\n- Benchmarks provide actionable comparison\\n- Weak sources are correctly identified\\n- Clusters group similar sources together\\n- Export produces professional report\\n- Drill-down reveals source details\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- Factor weight calibration\\n- Benchmark data availability and freshness\\n- Clustering stability with varying data\\n