ContradictionExplorer** - Main container with list and detail view\\n2. **ClaimComparison** - Side-by-side conflicting claims\\n3. **SourceQualityCompare** - Compare backing sources\\n4. **ResolutionSuggester** - AI-powered resolution strategies\\n5. **ConfidenceImpactSim** - What-if analysis for resolutions\\n6. **SeverityClassifier** - Visual severity indicators\\n7. **ResolutionTracker** - Resolution status and history\\n8. **EvidenceLinkPanel** - Supporting evidence for each claim\\n9. **ResolutionVoting** - Team decision-making UI\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- LLM for resolution suggestions (structured output)\\n- Confidence propagation algorithm for impact simulation\\n- Severity scoring based on source quality diff, claim importance\\n- LocalStorage for resolution drafts\\n- Supabase for persisted resolutions\\n- Real-time updates for team voting\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ContradictionExplorer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ClaimComparison.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/SourceQualityCompare.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ResolutionSuggester.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ConfidenceImpactSim.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ResolutionTracker.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/contradictionResolution.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useContradictionExplorer.ts`\\n- Create: API route: `src/app/api/contradictions/resolve/route.ts`\\n- Modify: ContradictionMatrix.tsx - Link to explorer\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- Claims compare clearly side-by-side\\n- Source quality diff highlights credibility gap\\n- AI suggestions are actionable and relevant\\n- Impact simulation shows confidence changes\\n- Severity accurately reflects importance\\n- Resolutions persist across sessions\\n- Team voting reflects in real-time\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- AI resolution quality and relevance\\n- Confidence propagation complexity\\n- Real-time voting synchronization\\n- Handling deeply nested contradictions\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Trust Visualizations direction 2"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2141,"cache_read_input_tokens":152679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2141},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"d8cdc649-ca66-42c6-84f5-02ad9a00bc9d"}
