[2026-01-29T23:53:45.735Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01XEqzBZKfe5oauCUT3JcJFS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CzAyV49d1FWnS9BYpNHc3W","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727807388_g0e6x6e\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Network & Relationship Graphs\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727807388_g0e6x6e\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Network & Relationship Graphs\",\n  \"summary\": \"Build advanced force-directed graph with hierarchical clustering, path finding, and dynamic layout algorithms\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Advanced Force-Directed Graph with Hierarchical Clustering\\n\\n### Vision\\nUpgrade the network visualization into a professional-grade force-directed graph with advanced layout algorithms, hierarchical clustering, shortest path finding, and dynamic grouping capabilities. Support graphs with 500+ nodes without performance degradation.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Essential for complex investigation mapping\\n- Reveals hidden connection patterns\\n- Path finding accelerates insight discovery\\n- Clustering reduces cognitive overload\\n- Professional-grade tool for analysts\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- Advanced force-directed layout (d3-force with WebGL)\\n- Hierarchical clustering with expandable groups\\n- Shortest path highlighting between nodes\\n- Multiple layout algorithms (force, radial, hierarchical)\\n- Node filtering by type, confidence, connections\\n- Edge bundling for complex graphs\\n- Minimap navigation for large graphs\\n- Node search with highlight\\n- Export graph as image/JSON\\n- Performance optimization for 500+ nodes\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Graph editing (add/remove nodes)\\n- External graph database integration\\n\\n### Key Components\\n1. **AdvancedNetworkGraph** - Main WebGL-powered graph container\\n2. **HierarchicalClusterer** - Auto-group related nodes\\n3. **PathFinder** - Shortest path algorithm implementation\\n4. **LayoutSwitcher** - Switch between layout algorithms\\n5. **EdgeBundler** - Reduce visual clutter in dense graphs\\n6. **GraphMinimap** - Overview navigation panel\\n7. **NodeSearcher** - Find and highlight nodes\\n8. **GraphFilterPanel** - Filter by attributes\\n9. **GraphExporter** - Export visualization\\n\\n### Technical Approach\\n- Sigma.js or react-force-graph for WebGL rendering\\n- d3-force for physics simulation\\n- Louvain algorithm for community detection\\n- Dijkstra/A* for path finding\\n- Edge bundling via FDEB algorithm\\n- Canvas rendering fallback for older browsers\\n- Web Worker for layout computation\\n- Progressive rendering for large graphs\\n\\n### Files to Create/Modify\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/AdvancedNetworkGraph.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/HierarchicalClusterer.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/PathFinder.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/LayoutSwitcher.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/EdgeBundler.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphMinimap.tsx`\\n- Create: `src/lib/graphAlgorithms.ts`\\n- Create: `src/workers/graphLayout.worker.ts`\\n- Create: `src/hooks/useForceGraph.ts`\\n- Modify: NetworkGraph.tsx - Upgrade to new system\\n\\n### Success Criteria\\n- 500+ nodes render at 30+ fps\\n- Clusters form meaningful groups\\n- Path finding identifies relevant routes\\n- Layout algorithms produce clear visualizations\\n- Edge bundling reduces visual clutter\\n- Minimap accurately represents graph\\n- Search finds nodes instantly\\n- Export produces high-quality images\\n\\n### Potential Challenges\\n- WebGL compatibility on older devices\\n- Layout stability during interactions\\n- Path finding performance for large graphs\\n- Cluster label positioning\"\n}\nEOF","description":"Save Network Graphs direction 1"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6209,"cache_read_input_tokens":159631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6209},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"576f84e7-8170-418b-9725-6d66bb5ecd8b"}
