[2026-01-29T23:54:05.258Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01SdwstKky9JUJRuhysDiHNo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011SWBTaa2tm3MnLeCyRzpmF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/directions -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d @- << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"project_id\": \"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\n  \"context_id\": \"ctx_1769727807388_g0e6x6e\",\n  \"context_name\": \"Network & Relationship Graphs\",\n  \"context_map_id\": \"ctx_1769727807388_g0e6x6e\",\n  \"context_map_title\": \"Network & Relationship Graphs\",\n  \"summary\": \"Create entity relationship inspector with AI-inferred connections, relationship timeline, and influence scoring\",\n  \"direction\": \"## Entity Relationship Inspector with AI-Inferred Connections\\n\\n### Vision\\nBuild a deep-dive entity relationship tool that goes beyond explicit connections to infer hidden relationships using AI. Show how relationships evolve over time, calculate influence scores, and enable investigation-style link analysis.\\n\\n### Business Value\\n- Uncovers hidden connections that research misses\\n- Investigation-style analysis for due diligence\\n- Influence scoring prioritizes important entities\\n- Temporal view shows relationship evolution\\n- Essential for investigative research template\\n\\n### Scope\\n**Included:**\\n- AI-inferred relationship suggestions\\n- Relationship strength and type classification\\n- Temporal relationship evolution view\\n- Influence/centrality scoring\\n- Degrees of separation calculation\\n- Relationship evidence linking (which findings support)\\n- Entity profile cards with relationship summary\\n- Investigation board mode (pin and connect)\\n- Relationship strength filtering\\n- Export entity relationship report\\n\\n**Out of Scope:**\\n- Real-time entity monitoring\\n- External entity database enrichment\\n\\n### Key Components\\n